# ========================================
# STATUS & BADGES
# ========================================
status-active = Active
status-inactive = Inactive
```

## Best Practices

### 1. Always Use Translations
```typescript
// ❌ BAD - Hardcoded text
<Button>Save</Button>
<p>Welcome to our application</p>

// ✅ GOOD - Translated text
<Button>{t('save-button')}</Button>
<p>{t('welcome-message')}</p>
```

### 2. Provide Context in Keys
```ftl
# ❌ BAD - Unclear context
title = Name
button = Save

# ✅ GOOD - Clear context
form-name-label = Name
save-button = Save
table-header-name = Name
```

### 3. Use Comments for Organization
```ftl
# ========================================
# SECTION TITLE
# ========================================
key = value

# Subsection
key = value
```

### 4. Keep Translation Files in Sync
- All three language files must have the same keys
- Order keys consistently across files
- Update all language files when adding new keys

### 5. Handle Plural Forms Correctly
```ftl
# English (different singular/plural)
items-count = { $count ->
    [one] { $count } item
   *[other] { $count } items
}

# German (different singular/plural)
items-count = { $count ->
    [one] { $count } Artikel
   *[other] { $count } Artikel
}
```

## Variable Naming

Use descriptive variable names:
```ftl
# ✅ GOOD
welcome-user = Welcome, { $userName }!
date-range = From { $startDate } to { $endDate }
items-info = Showing { $currentCount } of { $totalCount }

# ❌ BAD
welcome-user = Welcome, { $x }!
date-range = From { $a } to { $b }
```

